WEBVTT

00:09:27.734 --> 00:09:30.514
I hope to make reading a daily habit,

00:09:30.538 --> 00:09:33.761
as easy and effortless
as checking your email,

00:09:34.800 --> 00:09:36.490
as booking a ticket online

00:09:36.514 --> 00:09:38.101
or ordering your groceries.

00:09:38.800 --> 00:09:40.395
And as for me,

00:09:40.419 --> 00:09:44.516
I've discovered that as I entered
the six-inch world of the smartphone,

00:09:44.540 --> 00:09:47.006
my own world just got very, very big.

00:09:48.484 --> 00:09:49.682
Thank you.

00:09:49.706 --> 00:09:53.586
(Applause)